sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant PD as Processes Dashboard
    participant PBM as Process Builder Modal
    participant API as Backend API
    participant IS as Integration Service
    participant WS as Worker Service
    participant DB as Database

    U->>PD: Access processes dashboard
    PD->>U: Display process metrics and existing processes
    
    Note over U, PD: User initiates process creation
    U->>PD: Click "Create New Process"
    PD->>PBM: Open Process Builder Modal
    PBM->>U: Display "Process Details" tab (active)
    
    Note over PBM: Step 1: Basic Process Information
    PBM->>U: Show process details form
    U->>PBM: Enter process name "Weekly Newsletter Campaign"
    U->>PBM: Select department "Marketing"
    U->>PBM: Select priority level "Medium"
    U->>PBM: Enter process description (rich text)
    
    Note over PBM: Step 2: Integration Configuration
    PBM->>U: Show integration categories
    PBM->>IS: GET /api/integrations/available
    IS->>PBM: Return integration catalog
    PBM->>U: Display categorized integrations
    
    U->>PBM: Expand "Communication & Email" category
    PBM->>U: Show available email tools
    U->>PBM: Select Mailchimp (connected)
    U->>PBM: Select Gmail (connected)
    
    U->>PBM: Expand "Design & Creative" category
    U->>PBM: Select Canva (needs connection)
    PBM->>IS: Check Canva connection status
    IS->>PBM: Connection required
    PBM->>U: Show "Connect Canva" option
    U->>PBM: Click "Connect Canva"
    PBM->>IS: Initiate Canva OAuth flow
    IS->>U: Redirect to Canva authorization
    U->>IS: Authorize Canva access
    IS->>PBM: Connection established
    PBM->>U: Update integration status to "Connected"
    
    Note over PBM: Step 3: Process Preview
    U->>PBM: Click "Process Preview" tab
    PBM->>WS: GET /api/workers/marketing-specialist
    WS->>PBM: Return worker type information
    PBM->>U: Show process preview card
    PBM->>U: Display selected tools visualization
    PBM->>U: Show AI worker perspective preview
    
    Note over PBM: Step 4: Process Validation
    PBM->>API: POST /api/processes/validate
    API->>IS: Verify integration connections
    IS->>API: All integrations valid
    API->>WS: Check worker availability
    WS->>API: Marketing specialist available
    API->>PBM: Validation successful
    
    Note over PBM: Step 5: Process Deployment
    U->>PBM: Click "Create Process"
    PBM->>API: POST /api/processes/create
    API->>DB: Save process configuration
    DB->>API: Process created with ID
    API->>WS: Assign process to worker type
    WS->>API: Assignment confirmed
    API->>IS: Configure process integrations
    IS->>API: Integrations configured
    API->>PBM: Process created successfully
    
    PBM->>PD: Close modal, refresh dashboard
    PD->>API: GET /api/processes
    API->>PD: Return updated process list
    PD->>U: Show new process in table with "Active" status
    
    Note over PD: Process appears with metrics
    PD->>U: Display updated KPIs (128 total processes)
    PD->>U: Show process in "Recent Activity" feed 